    "description": "Transparent Pricing! Sellers are moving out at the end of October and are motivated to sell now. An excellent opportunity to own in Bernal Heights. This versatile home offers 2 bedrooms, 2 baths, and 3 bonus rooms across 2 levels. The main level features 2 spacious bedrooms, an updated bath, and a remodeled kitchen with wood-block counters, stainless-steel appliances, and access to a covered deck overlooking a terraced yard. A formal dining area, hardwood floors, and a cozy fireplace complete the space. The lower level adds flexibility with 3 bonus rooms currently used as a media area, home office, and guest suite, plus an updated full bath. Highlights include solar panels, a smart home, newer windows, custom built-ins, and a garage with interior access. Ideally located on a quiet Bernal Heights street close to Cortland Ave shops, cafs, and Bernal Hill Park."
